  "description": "I worked myself to death in 21st-century South Korea and died from overwork. When I opened my eyes, I had been reincarnated as the precious youngest daughter of a Count’s family—the kind of family you’d only ever see in a fantasy novel. I had money, a home, and a loving family to rely on. My only goal for this life was to live comfortably, spending my days doing nothing but playing, eating, and enjoying myself! …Or so I thought.\nSource: MU",
